{{!-- The pill strip itself: a label, and one link per tag, in the three sizes the design draws.

	{{> "tag-pills" tags=tags label=(t "Browse by tag")}}               A1's homepage strip
	{{> "tag-pills" tags=tags label=(t "Browse by tag") wide=true}}     A2's homepage strip, with counts
	{{> "tag-pills" tags=tags label=(t "Other tags") stacked=true headingId="other-tags"}}
	                                                                    the tag archive's

	tags        the rows to render — always passed in, never queried here
	label       the strip's own word for itself
	wide        the A2 sizing: a full-width row, each pill carrying its post count
	stacked     the tag archive's sizing, the label on its own line above the pills
	headingId   render the label as an <h2> with this id, so a section can be labelled by it

The markup lives apart from tag-strip.hbs because the tag archive draws the same strip over a
DIFFERENT query — every tag except the one being read. A {{#get}} cannot take a filter
conditionally: `filter="slug:-{{exclude}}"` with nothing to exclude reaches NQL as `slug:-` and
fails the whole query. So each caller owns its {{#get}} and hands the rows here, and the pill is
written once.

Every branch spells its class list out in full. A class assembled at render time is a class
Tailwind's scanner never sees in the source, so it is never compiled — the same reason
chrome/header.hbs writes its two bars out twice. --}}
{{#if stacked}}
	<div>
		{{#if headingId}}
			<h2
				id="{{headingId}}"
				class="font-ui text-muted mb-[18px] text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase">{{label}}</h2>
		{{else}}
			<span class="font-ui text-muted mb-[18px] text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase">{{label}}</span>
		{{/if}}

		<div class="strip flex gap-2.5 p-0.5">
			{{#foreach tags}}
				<a
					href="{{url}}"
					class="font-meta tracking-meta border-border bg-surface text-text hover:border-accent hover:text-accent rounded-pill flex-none border px-4 py-[9px] text-[12.5px] whitespace-nowrap uppercase no-underline">{{name}}
					<span class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px]">{{count.posts}}</span></a>
			{{/foreach}}
		</div>
	</div>
{{else}}
	{{#if wide}}
		<div class="max-stack:block flex flex-wrap items-center gap-[18px]">
			<span
				class="font-ui text-muted max-stack:mb-3.5 max-stack:block text-[11.5px] font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] whitespace-nowrap uppercase">{{label}}</span>

			<div class="strip flex gap-[9px] p-0.5">
				{{#foreach tags}}
					<a
						href="{{url}}"
						class="font-meta tracking-meta border-border bg-surface text-text hover:border-accent hover:text-accent rounded-pill flex-none border px-[15px] py-2 text-[12.5px] whitespace-nowrap uppercase no-underline">{{name}}
						<span class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px]">{{count.posts}}</span></a>
				{{/foreach}}
			</div>
		</div>
	{{else}}
		<div
			class="max-stack:ml-0 max-stack:block max-stack:w-full ml-auto flex min-w-0 flex-[0_1_auto] items-center gap-3.5">
			<span
				class="font-ui text-muted max-stack:mb-3.5 max-stack:block text-[11.5px] font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] whitespace-nowrap uppercase">{{label}}</span>

			<div class="strip flex gap-2 p-0.5">
				{{#foreach tags}}
					<a
						href="{{url}}"
						class="font-meta tracking-meta border-border bg-surface text-text hover:border-accent hover:text-accent rounded-pill flex-none border px-[13px] py-[7px] text-xs whitespace-nowrap uppercase no-underline">{{name}}</a>
				{{/foreach}}
			</div>
		</div>
	{{/if}}
{{/if}}
